Melodex licensing status
========================

This repository does not currently include an open-source license grant.
Nothing in the public availability of this source code, its Git history, or
its documentation should be interpreted as permission to copy, modify,
redistribute, sublicense, or sell the software.

The copyright and other rights in the Melodex project remain with their
respective rights holders unless a separate written license says otherwise.
Third-party components are licensed separately; see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

This file records the repository's current licensing status. It is not legal
advice. Select and publish an actual project license before distributing
Melodex as open-source software.
